{"id":12,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"三つの教育を土台に探究女子を育成","feature_description":"トキワ松学園は「探究女子」の育成を掲げ、思考力・国際力・美の教育を三つの柱にしています。思考力教育では課題発見や解決に取り組み、国際力教育では英語や海外研修、美の教育では芸術や感性を学びます。中学生には好奇心・向上心・自立心を求め、課題に気づき仲間と共有する姿勢も大切にしています。疑問を持ち、調べ、発表する学びを重ねます。","clubs":[{"id":12733,"name":"ダンス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12734,"name":"水泳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12735,"name":"ラクロス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12736,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12737,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12738,"name":"硬式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12739,"name":"写真","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12740,"name":"国際交流","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12741,"name":"書道","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12742,"name":"吹奏楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12743,"name":"調理","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12744,"name":"演劇","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12745,"name":"マンガ研究","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tokiwamatsu.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12746